SDDM login theme matching the Quickshell lock screen (~/.config/quickshell/LockScreen.qml).

SDDM can't read the home folder, so install a copy:
    sudo cp -r ~/.config/sddm-theme/tokyo-night /usr/share/sddm/themes/
    printf '[Theme]\nCurrent=tokyo-night\n' | sudo tee /etc/sddm.conf.d/10-theme.conf
Revert: sudo rm /etc/sddm.conf.d/10-theme.conf  (back to Fedora's 03-sway-fedora)
Preview in a window: sddm-greeter-qt6 --test-mode --theme ~/.config/sddm-theme/tokyo-night
